              12                     !setted*
              13                     !* in the main program. The mark '##' before the variables means the
              14                     !*
              15                     !* output variabels.
              16                     !*
              17                     !*
              18                     !* EDITED BY
              19                     !*
              20                     !* Jia-ying Wu 2017,09
